### Retrieve documents
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/retrieval/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the capital of France?",
  "config": {
    "topK": 2,
    "useBm25": true,
    "useReranker": true
  }
}


### Embeddings
POST  https://embedding-inference-model-serving.apps.openshift-ai.mgnt.zas.admin.ch/embeddings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "embedding-inference",
  "input": "The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog"
}